  "description": "The official, all-in-one Podargus UI component suite. Stop importing piecemeal libraries. This zero-dependency flagship package contains 10 hardware-accelerated, anti-aliased controls to completely modernize your Windows Forms applications. Includes: ModernDataGridView, ModernTabControl, ModernTextBox, ModernButton, ModernToggle, ModernTrackBar, ModernProgressRing, AdvancedImageViewer, SpeedoMeter, and ModernDialogs. Features global Dark/Light mode routing, 5 premium design styles, and full Visual Studio Designer support.",
