  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 Initial Flagship Release:\n\t\t\t- Consolidated the entire Podargus ecosystem (10 controls) into a single, high-performance UI suite.\n\t\t\t- Unified namespaces to Podargus.UI.WinForms for seamless developer onboarding.\n\t\t\t- Integrated global 2-Theme (Dark/Light) and 5-Style design matrix across all components.\n\t\t\t- Includes: ModernDataGridView, ModernTabControl, ModernTextBox, ModernButton, ModernToggle, ModernTrackBar, ModernProgressRing, AdvancedImageViewer, SpeedoMeter, and ModernDialogs.\n\t\t\t- Zero external dependencies with native multi-targeting for .NET Framework 4.7.2+ and .NET 6.0/8.0+.",
